page 2 entries of TANGO_TEMPLATE_CONF): the CONF_STR menu string of Template_MiSTer
(https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Template_MiSTer, Template.sv 58-86, read at 19e89ce), copied as
text. Template.sv's header: GPL version 2 or (at your option) any later version
(GPL-2.0-or-later); it names no author. The repository's LICENSE is the GNU GPL version 2.

tango/test/test_confstr.c (MENU): the CONF_STR of Menu_MiSTer
(https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Menu_MiSTer, menu.sv; at fa83dc1 its CONF_STR is lines 60-64),
with a build date of its own. menu.sv's header: "Copyright (C) 2017-2020 Sorgelig", GPL version
2 or (at your option) any later version (GPL-2.0-or-later).

tango/cosim/fixtures/mra_arcade_proof.mra and mra_galaga.mra: tag and attribute text copied
from MiSTer arcade .mra files (named in each fixture's own comment; no ROM data). Those .mra
files state no licence.


